<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Halaman Tidak Ditemukan | Kuotax</title>
    <%- include('partials/pwa-head') %>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=6">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }
        .animate-float {
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .animate-pulse-glow {
            animation: pulseGlow 3s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-12px) rotate(2deg); }
        }
        @keyframes pulseGlow {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 0.8; transform: scale(1.08); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-white min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 relative overflow-hidden selection:bg-emerald-500 selection:text-white">
    <!-- Ambient Background Gradients -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none animate-pulse-glow"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-indigo-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-lg w-full text-center relative z-10">
        <!-- 404 Icon & Badge Graphic -->
        <div class="relative inline-block mb-6">
            <div class="w-28 h-28 sm:w-36 sm:h-36 bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-500/20 to-teal-500/10 rounded-3xl border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto backdrop-blur-xl animate-float shadow-2xl shadow-emerald-500/20">
                <i class="fas fa-compass-slash text-5xl sm:text-6xl text-emerald-400"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 px-3 py-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 to-pink-500 text-white text-xs font-extrabold rounded-full shadow-lg border border-white/20 uppercase tracking-widest">
                Error 404
            </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Text Content -->
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-3">
            Halaman Tidak Ditemukan
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">
            Maaf, halaman yang Anda cari tidak dapat ditemukan, telah dipindahkan, atau alamat URL yang Anda ketik kurang tepat.
        </p>

        <!-- Navigation Action Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
            <button onclick="history.back()" 
                class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-semibold text-sm transition border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md">
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-left text-xs"></i> Kembali Sebelumnya
            </button>
            <a href="/" 
                class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-600 hover:to-teal-700 text-white font-extrabold text-sm transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/25 border border-emerald-400/30">
                <i class="fas fa-home text-xs"></i> Ke Dashboard Utama
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Help Link Footer -->
        <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs text-slate-500">
            Butuh bantuan? Silakan buka <a href="/catalog" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline font-semibold">Katalog Kuota</a> atau kontak dukungan kami.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
